lysis and phase 2b trial\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Vaccine efficacy was calculated as (1 – [P / (1 – P)]) x 100%\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"All differences between vaccine group and placebo group were not statistically significant, as determined by nonoverlapping CIs.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The Work Group used the Grading of Recommendations, Assessment, Development, and Evaluation (GRADE) approach\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"data_focus\", \"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}